OCPP JSON Schemas
-----------------

The JSON schema files under cmd/generate-ocpp-types/schemas/ are published by
the Open Charge Alliance (OCA) as part of the Open Charge Point Protocol
specifications, and are redistributed here unmodified for use with the code
generator in cmd/generate-ocpp-types.

Covered schema sets:

  - OCPP 1.5   (cmd/generate-ocpp-types/schemas/1.5/)
  - OCPP 1.6   (cmd/generate-ocpp-types/schemas/1.6/)
  - OCPP 2.0.1 (cmd/generate-ocpp-types/schemas/2.0.1/)
  - OCPP 2.1   (cmd/generate-ocpp-types/schemas/2.1/)

The OCPP 2.1 schemas are licensed by the Open Charge Alliance under the
